"P3337469454" "From the piece of evidence you've collected, you've determined that the Family are running drugs out of a small abandoned office. You know the place. It's overrun with homeless and is in serious need of a 'renovation.'<br><br>Perhaps you could kill two birds with one stone. Or in this case two problems with one well placed explosive.<br><br><color orange>Completing this mission will move you're moral compass towards Vigilante. If you're already Vigilante, they you shall remain steadfast in your beliefs."
